      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "[Kibana에서 상세 로그 열기](/kibana/) · 이 대시보드는 원문 로그를 표시할 수 있습니다. 원문 로그나 개인정보 필드는 알림 메시지에 포함하지 않습니다.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.1",
      "title": "Log Explorer",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Spring MVC의 저카디널리티 URI 템플릿과 예외 타입별 5xx 발생률입니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "hideZeros": false,
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (uri, exception) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"spring_boot\", environment=\"$environment\", application=\"$application\", status=~\"5..\", uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} · {{exception}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP 5xx Rate by URI & Exception",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
      },
      "description": "Elasticsearch의 구조화 로그 level 필드로 집계합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "hideZeros": false,
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "ERROR",
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "field": "@timestamp",
              "id": "2",
              "settings": {
                "interval": "auto",
                "min_doc_count": 0
              },
              "type": "date_histogram"
            }
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "type": "count"
            }
          ],
          "query": "service:laimory AND environment:$environment AND level:ERROR",
          "refId": "A",
          "timeField": "@timestamp"
        },
        {
          "alias": "WARN",
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "field": "@timestamp",
              "id": "2",
              "settings": {
                "interval": "auto",
                "min_doc_count": 0
              },
              "type": "date_histogram"
            }
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "type": "count"
            }
          ],
          "query": "service:laimory AND environment:$environment AND level:WARN",
          "refId": "B",
          "timeField": "@timestamp"
        }
      ],
      "title": "ERROR & WARN Logs",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
      },
      "description": "구조화 access log(event=http_request_completed)의 상태 코드별 실패 건수입니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "hideZeros": false,
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "4xx",
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "field": "@timestamp",
              "id": "2",
              "settings": {
                "interval": "auto",
                "min_doc_count": 0
              },
              "type": "date_histogram"
            }
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "type": "count"
            }
          ],
          "query": "service:laimory AND environment:$environment AND event:http_request_completed AND status:[400 TO 499]",
          "refId": "A",
          "timeField": "@timestamp"
        },
        {
          "alias": "5xx",
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "field": "@timestamp",
              "id": "2",
              "settings": {
                "interval": "auto",
                "min_doc_count": 0
              },
              "type": "date_histogram"
            }
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "type": "count"
            }
          ],
          "query": "service:laimory AND environment:$environment AND event:http_request_completed AND status:[500 TO 599]",
          "refId": "B",
          "timeField": "@timestamp"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP Failure Logs",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
      },
      "description": "최근 Laimory 원문 로그입니다. 상세 필드에는 운영 문맥이 포함될 수 있으므로 접근 통제된 Grafana/Kibana 안에서만 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "",
          "bucketAggs": [],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "elasticsearch-dev"
          },
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "settings": {
                "size": 500
              },
              "type": "logs"
            }
          ],
          "query": "service:laimory AND environment:$environment",
          "refId": "A",
          "timeField": "@timestamp"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Recent Application Logs",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
